# Love Me Do, verse: the drawn-out word (figure 21.4)
# Paul holds G above John's scale-wise line E D C, returning to E (over the IV chord, C).
# Rhythm follows the verse chart (fig. 21.2): the syllables fall on beats 1, 3, 4 and the next bar.
#? Matching the four notes to fig. 21.2's syllables (2+1+1 beats, then a bar) is my reading; the
#? typed figure gives no rhythm. Octaves as in fig. 21.3.
key G

system
voice "Paul"   | G4*2 G4 G4 | G4 |
voice "John"   | E4*2 D4 C4 | E4 |
